	order_index: 3
	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"The tiers represent different stages of progression that include some armor sets with the following defense in order:"
				""
				"Tier I - Defense 0-5 on chestplate"
				"Tier II - Defense 6-7 on chestplate"
				"Tier III - Defense 8 on chestplate"
				"Tier IV - Defense 9-11 on chestplate"
				"Tier V - Defense 12-13 on chestplate"
				"Tier VI - Defense 14-15 on chestplate"
				"&k&5Tier VII - Defense 15+ on chestplate&r&r"
				""
				"There are only sets with abilities or magic spell power buffs that are included in this chapter. There aren't MOSTLY any ore/non ability sets."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Some armor sets may have lesser defense while being in a higher tier. This is because some sets have other qualities that make them rank so high up."
				""
				"Also, there are sometimes half-sets which means that armor set isn't finished (Has 1-2 pieces of armor missing) but some are still included because of their great synnergy with other parts of armor from different sets."
			]
			id: "319DCF0EEB54E158"
			rewards: [{
				id: "3426B07A80AE3A30"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 5
			}]
